; AdaptiveMultiStrategyEA - gold trend sleeve, LARGE setting (chapter 104). HIGH RISK. Needs a commodity CFD account.
; Rule (unchanged): hold gold while its close is above the 200-day average, reviewed every 7 days.
; Size: three times AMS_Sleeves_Gold.set (InpIxTrendUnitVol=33.6), with a stop re-based every day at 4 x daily volatility.
; Tested with the EA on public minute data (not yet on the broker's own data):
;   last 3 years (Nov 2023 - Oct 2026, gold rose from 1,982 to 3,875 USD): +296%, drawdown 41%, best 12 months +318%,
;     by year: 2024 +75%, 2025 +138%, 2026 about 0%.
;   2010 - 2026: about +8% per year with a 77% drawdown. It lost every year from 2012 to 2018
;     (-3%, -13%, -29%, -13%, -12%, -22%, -6%). The size pays only while gold keeps trending.
; Attach to an XAUUSD chart (H1).
InpEntryMode=8
InpIxRevSymbols=none
InpIxTrendSymbols=XAUUSD
InpIxRuleR2=false
InpIxRuleD7=false
InpIxRuleIBS=false
InpIxRevUnitVol=0.0
InpIxTrendUnitVol=33.6
InpIxTrendCheckDays=7
InpIxMaxLev=10.0
InpIxBand=0.25
InpIxSLVolMul=4.0
InpIxVolModel=0
InpIxVixFile=none
InpIxRuleWeights=1,2,3
InpIxSoGuard=0.9
InpIxFlatMinutes=0
InpIxDelayMin=5
InpIxMaxSpreadPct=0.05
InpMaxMarginUsePct=80.0
InpIxJointRound=false
InpIxWarmStart=false
InpIxRegimeDays=0
InpIxRegimeRef=none
InpIxDryRun=false
InpIxEquityOffset=0
